 Friday ✅.

 Today's newsletter is 736 words, a 3-minute read. 

 📈 The dashboard: The S&amp;P 500 closed up 0.2%.

 The index ends the week down 0.1%. It's up 11.8% for the year. 🔥 Today's stock spotlight: Coinbase (+11.7%) strung together a two-day rally following the SEC's move yesterday to allow tokenized stock trading in the U.S. and today's 6% gain in bitcoin. 

 
 
